            "review_title": "Review at Taurus Express - Fast'n Fresh",
            "review_text": "Jean A\nNha Trang, Vietnam11 contributions\n2\nGreat place to hang out in Nha Trang!\nAug 2018 • Couples\nWe've been here a few times already as it's near to Co-Op Mart. Really pretty cafe with lovely ambience for food and drinks! We've tried quite a few things on the menu and it's all really tasty and cheap - Crispy Calamari & Crispy Shrimp were awesome, so were the freshly made Deep Fried Springrolls. For the mains we've also had the burger, the spaghetti bolognese and the Vietnamese BBQ Pork Rib rice - all good but the Vietnamese rice dish was my favourite - very tasty! Also the Avocado Shake and the Iced Milk Tea were very creamy and delicious - none of that watered-down rubbish you get elsewhere. We'll be back here for sure. Oh and the Russian Salad rocks!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 23, 2018",
